# The tvbox-wc release the box runs, verified by sha256.
#
# Sourced by install-compositor.sh. With TAG empty it builds from a source tree on
# the box instead, which is the development path and the only one until the first
# release is cut.
#
# To pin a release:
#   TAG=v0.1.0
#   SHA256=<sha256 of tvbox-wc-aarch64 from that release>
TAG=""
SHA256=""
